Great news =
=E2=80=94 your booking for Tandem Skydive is confirmed.

Date: Saturday=
 18 July 2026, 09:00
Location: Dunkeswell, Devon
Reference: BK-XY34ZW=


We'll send a reminder closer to the day. Any questions in the meantim=
e, just reply to this email.

Before your jump

Arrival & timing: P=
lease arrive 30 minutes before your slot time so we can complete your paper=
work and brief without rushing. Allow a few hours on site =E2=80=94 jumps c=
an be delayed by weather and we go in slot order.

What to bring: Wear =
comfortable clothes and trainers (no sandals). Bring a jumper for the colde=
r air at altitude, any required medical paperwork, and a form of ID. Leave =
valuables at home or with a friend.

What to expect: You'll meet your i=
nstructor, get a full safety brief, then gear up. After the climb to altitu=
de it's a 30-45 second freefall and a 5-minute canopy ride back down. Photo=
s and video can be added on the day.

Blue skies,
The G-Force team
